{"title":"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At Clover View Junior High, one half of the students go home on the school bus.  One fourth go home by automobile.  One tenth go home on their bicycles.  The rest walk home.  What fractional part of the students walk home?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/5/be5e2907e5315c35762248ec43fa9aad377c2ec2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\dfrac{1}{16} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\dfrac{3}{20} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\dfrac{1}{3} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\dfrac{17}{20} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\dfrac{9}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"389\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The students who walk home are\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/c/04cffacecb55c4de847bcd1d6e27a070bc19c9fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 - \\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{1}{4} - \\frac{1}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"122\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/2/012bb4dfe5ca5d328b69dfb3d0b0e2fcf4097dfc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{1}{4} - \\frac{1}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"91\" height=\"37\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/1/711c5a1ba1aecbb0c49d69824708c4a31ba07a30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4} - \\frac{1}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"56\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/4/c349e6d13fcc2530720ec1baf0d81a5822c32af4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{20} - \\frac{2}{20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"65\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/a/42af18b56be196e26c9a14c0fb831b44098ab5a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> of the entire student population.  Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2e33ab9a00e021af49e888212645d4667903c49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME\" title=\"1995 AJHSME\">1995 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1995\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Pr